cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use QbD-VLA, please cite the paper below.
title: "Quantize by Doing: Task-Guided Mixed-Precision Quantization of Vision-Language-Action Models"
abstract: >-
  A task-guided mixed-precision quantization method for vision-language-action
  models that selects weight and activation bit widths per layer group from
  task success in short closed-loop evaluations, scoring every candidate with
  the other groups at their current bit widths and bounding the simulation cost
  with a sequential test on Wilson bounds.
